menu "Rotary Macro Pad"

config ROTARY_STEP_DEG
    int "Rotation per detent (degrees)"
    range 1 90
    default 5
    help
      How far one click of the ring rotates the FreeCAD view or the Blender
      selection. The design offers 1, 5, 15 and 45.

      Blender gets this value typed in (R <axis> <step> Enter), so any value
      works there. FreeCAD's RotaryHid add-on rotates by its own StepDeg
      parameter (docs/apps.md, FreeCAD setup) -- set the two to the same
      number or the angle shown on the pad will not match the view.

config ROTARY_KDENLIVE_FRAMES_PER_DETENT
    int "Kdenlive frames per ring click (frame mode)"
    range 1 30
    default 5
    help
      How far one click of the ring scrubs in frame mode. Kdenlive's arrow
      keys move one frame and it has no "N frames" shortcut, so the pad
      presses the arrow this many times per click (about 16 ms each). Set 1
      for single-frame precision. Second mode is always one second per
      click; tap the centre of the pad to switch.

config ROTARY_VSCODIUM_LINES_PER_DETENT
    int "VSCodium lines scrolled per ring click"
    range 1 20
    default 3
    help
      How far one click of the ring scrolls the editor in line mode. The pad
      sends Ctrl+Up/Down (VS Code's scroll-line command, which scrolls
      without moving the cursor) this many times per click. Push the ring to
      switch to page scrolling (Alt+PgUp/PgDn).

config ROTARY_LIBREOFFICE_LINES_PER_DETENT
    int "LibreOffice lines per ring click"
    range 1 20
    default 3
    help
      How far one click of the ring moves in LibreOffice's line mode. The
      pad presses Up/Down this many times per click; that moves the text
      cursor in Writer and the active cell in Calc, and the view follows.
      Push the ring to switch to PgUp/PgDn.

config ROTARY_BROWSER_LINES_PER_DETENT
    int "Firefox / Chromium lines scrolled per ring click"
    range 1 20
    default 3
    help
      How far one click of the ring scrolls a web page in line mode. The pad
      presses Down/Up this many times per click (each is one arrow-key
      scroll step in the browser). Push the ring to switch to PgUp/PgDn.

config ROTARY_KDENLIVE_FPS
    int "Kdenlive project frame rate"
    range 1 120
    default 30
    help
      Used only for the timecode and the scrub strip on the pad. The pad
      cannot read the project's real frame rate.

endmenu
